OL,3,ABoots sold in #7bn deal to Canadian
OL,4,Abillionaire family
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoots, the High Street pharmacy and
OL,7,Fretail chain, has been sold in an
OL,8,F$8.9bn (#6.7bn) deal to Canada's
OL,9,Fbillionaire Weston family.
OL,11,FWittington Investments, the holding
OL,12,Fcompany, confirmed it had agreed to buy
OL,13,F177-year old company on Wednesday from
OL,14,FUS private equity firm Sycamore
OL,15,FPartners and the Pessina family.
OL,17,FBoots started as a simple apothecary in
OL,18,FNottingham but has evolved to become a
OL,19,Ffamiliar and trusted High Street
OL,20,Fpresence, selling a vast range of
OL,21,Fhealth and beauty products, meal deals
OL,22,Fand travel accessories.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
