OL,3,ABoots sold in #7bn deal to Canadian
OL,4,Abillionaire family
OL,5,
OL,6,FGalen Weston, chairman of Wittington,
OL,7,Fsaid Boots played "a vital role in
OL,8,Feveryday life across the UK and
OL,9,FIreland".
